      "role": "user",
      "content": "it's hard to see it that way though. it doesnt feel like a \"journey\" or a \"perspective\" thing. it feels like a pattern that never stops. i look at my family and all i see is a slow decay. like, every generation just gets a little more broken until there's nothing left. sometimes i look at them and just think... maybe the only way to actually stop the rot is to just not pass it on. to be the one where it just stops.",
